// Heroism: a touch-range spell granting a willing ally BOTH a temp-HP pool
// and immunity to fear in one cast. `SelfBuff` cannot deliver this -- that
// ability variant always lands its buffs on the caster (`entity: data.entity`
// in `common/src/states/self_buff.rs`), never on a touched ally. The
// established mechanism for "touch spell affecting an ally" in this engine is
// `attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup)` on a near-inert melee hit (see
// `lesser_restoration.ron`/`greater_restoration.ron`), but a single
// `melee_constructor` only exposes one redirectable `attack_effect` slot, so
// two ally-targeted buffs need two strikes. `ComboMelee2` with two quick,
// identical-range strikes is the smallest RON-only way to do that: strike one
// lands `Shielded` (the temp-HP absorb pool), strike two lands `Fearless`
// (fear immunity). Both use `damage: 1` (inert, matching the
// lesser/greater_restoration precedent) so the touch always registers as a
// hit without meaningfully harming the ally.
ComboMelee2(
    strikes: [
        (
            melee_constructor: (
                kind: Stab(damage: 1, poise: 0, knockback: 0, energy_regen: 0),
                range: 3.0,
                angle: 20.0,
                attack_effect: Some((
                    Buff((
                        kind: Shielded,
                        dur_secs: 60.0,
                        strength: Value(15.0),
                        chance: 1.0,
                    )),
                    AnyDamage,
                )),
                attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup),
            ),
            buildup_duration: 0.4,
            swing_duration: 0.1,
            hit_timing: 0.5,
            recover_duration: 0.2,
        ),
        (
            melee_constructor: (
                kind: Stab(damage: 1, poise: 0, knockback: 0, energy_regen: 0),
                range: 3.0,
                angle: 20.0,
                attack_effect: Some((
                    Buff((
                        kind: Fearless,
                        dur_secs: 60.0,
                        strength: Value(1.0),
                        chance: 1.0,
                    )),
                    AnyDamage,
                )),
                attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup),
            ),
            buildup_duration: 0.1,
            swing_duration: 0.1,
            hit_timing: 0.5,
            recover_duration: 0.4,
        ),
    ],
    energy_cost_per_strike: 20,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Enchantment),
        source: Some(Divine),
        // level 1 spell -> min_level 6, same `level * 6` convention every
        // other shipped spell follows (see see_invisibility.ron).
        requirements: (min_level: Some(6)),
    ),
)
